preConditionHook:
// A bull bar shaved at BOTH ends: it opens within tailOffsetPoints of its low
// and closes within tailOffsetPoints of its high (short: opens near its high
// and closes near its low).
//
// Cannot be built by ANDing two ShavedTopBar placements. A placement's short
// side is the REFLECTED condition, not the other end of the same side, so
// 'shaved top' and 'shaved bottom' as two panes give a bar shaved at the top
// on the long side and at the bottom on the short side -- never both ends of
// one side.
//
// The source states the tolerance in TICKS with a book value of 0. `minmove`
// and `pricescale` are UNKNOWN and ctx exposes no tick size, so it is carried
// as a PRICE-POINT input per AUTHORING.md; 0.25 (one Emini tick) is a safer
// default than the exact touch on a tick grid, and is instrument-specific.
